  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds built-in OpenTelemetry-compatible observability: a System.Diagnostics.Metrics Meter and an ActivitySource, both named SyslogLogging, covering per-entry and per-destination latency and outcome, syslog bytes sent, I/O lock wait, errors by type, MessageLogged handler time, retention cleanup runs, and lifecycle. Log entries now capture the current W3C trace and span IDs ({trace}/{span} header tokens, traceId/spanId in JSON). New LoggingSettings.EnableMetrics and EnableTracing toggles. No exporter dependency; near-zero cost when nothing subscribes. See TELEMETRY.md.",
